734
00:58:10,321 --> 00:58:11,155
Really?

735
00:58:12,656 --> 00:58:13,490
All right.

736
00:58:16,035 --> 00:58:18,537
I have to go.
Something needs my attention.

737
00:58:23,209 --> 00:58:24,627
I'll get going then…

738
00:58:27,046 --> 00:58:28,005
Hae-seon.

739
00:58:41,518 --> 00:58:42,353
Yeah.

740
00:58:44,146 --> 00:58:47,107
You have a photo of him as a child, huh?

741
00:58:49,151 --> 00:58:51,320
Are you sure this source is reliable?

742
00:58:53,364 --> 00:58:54,198
All right.

743
00:58:55,199 --> 00:58:57,534
Come to my office right now.

744
00:58:59,078 --> 00:58:59,995
ROUND 2 ELIMINATION

745
00:59:00,079 --> 00:59:03,290
The team to be eliminated
